From daa5211610ac150bfb2c8f05dc19fec3d96b78e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:57:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Desktop detail: the levels, the builder's cell rule, the
 pure model and the determinism test

Finer is 20 m and Finest 10 m (the two cells plan 15e measured), both with 8,000 embers, any area up to the 9 km measured, the High air allowed and the
air tier still the person's. SimOptions.desktopDetail records the level; with no level the builder, the request and the snapshot hashes are 0.8.0's
(the fifteen hashes of a Katoomba 6 km run are stored from the 0.8.0 source). The pure model has the label, the words, the history budget (no growth on a
phone's page, 384 MiB on a desktop-class one), the picture size and the two refusals (a page that cannot keep the pictures, a device that cannot run the grid).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
