Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Desktop detail: the label on the run, the statistics, the
 model card, the history budget, the estimator words and the Continue offer

A run made with a finer level loads one small chunk (desktopDetailRun) that gives its history budget (no growth on a phone's page) and the label chip on the map.
