From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:11:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Desktop detail: e2e on the stand-in host and one run on a
 real host

e2e/desktop-detail.spec.ts: the choice appears only with the desktop, the label on the map, in the statistics and in How sure are we?, no phone speed test for a
run on the desktop, the history budget (a phone's page unchanged, a desktop-class page 384 MiB), the label surviving Continue on this device, the offer of the
standard detail when this device cannot run the grid, the refusal on Setup, the row at four sizes in three looks, and Katoomba 3 km at 10 m on a real host
(wall time and picture sizes printed). Setup redraws its footer when the area changes under a finer level.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zPE7K49ycKieo7wJdrBFN
